				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 2D anime battle style with MAPPA-inspired dynamic sakuga animation and heavy cel shading. In a ruined city under a dark twilight sky, Satoru Gojo with white hair and glowing blindfolded eyes faces Ryomen Sukuna, covered in dark curses and tattoos. The camera pushes in fast as Gojo forms a hand seal, dark blue and crimson energy swirling violently around his fingers while he (S1) speaks: <d>[Japanese] 領域展開。</d> [Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts to an explosive wide angle as Sukuna slashes the air, sending massive red energy blades forward. Gojo unleashes a concentrated sphere of purple distorted space that collides head-on with Sukuna's slashes, shattering the surrounding concrete in a blinding flash of cursed energy.\n\noverall_soundscape: High-frequency energy hums rapidly pitch up, followed by sharp air-slicing swooshes and a thunderous cursed-energy explosion that crushes surrounding concrete debris.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: High-tempo anime battle rock featuring heavy electric guitar riffs and pounding drums that peak at the clash.",
