			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 3D CG, stylized, a medium shot frames a fluffy orange cat sitting on a wooden kitchen counter, staring intently at a silver toaster. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as the cat's ear twitches. The toaster suddenly pops with a loud spring sound, launching two golden slices of toast into the air. The cat's head snaps upward, tracking the toast as it arcs and lands back into the toaster slots. The cat blinks once and lets out a short, low-pitched meow.\n\noverall_soundscape: A soft kitchen hum underlies the scene, followed by the metallic spring-pop of the toaster and the light thud of toast landing back in the slots. A single cat meow ends the sequence.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A bouncy xylophone melody at a fast tempo, accompanied by a light pizzicato string pluck on each toast bounce, stopping abruptly after the final meow."
